unces her. Was: a longevity mission statement, with three competing names for the product and no description of what the software does."}]]}],["$","li","Light, because the reader is",{"className":"rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px] leading-[22px]","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground","children":"Light, because the reader is"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm","children":"The marketing site went light and warm to match how studio owners read it, on a phone between classes. Dark stayed where it earns its keep, in the product UI at 6am. Was: dark canvas, glow and 3D chrome, the grammar of developer tooling aimed at a non technical buyer."}]]}],["$","li","Proof above the fold",{"className":"rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px] leading-[22px]","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground","children":"Proof above the fold"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm","children":"Outcome numbers and named operator quotes sit high on the page, close to the claims they support. Was: \"Proven to Drive Growth\" with no metric, no screenshot and no named studio anywhere on the page."}]]}],["$","li","One story, one call to action",{"className":"rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px] leading-[22px]","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground","children":"One story, one call to action"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm","children":"Duplicate sections merged into a single narrative, and every path ends at the same action with the same label. Was: two sections repeating one promise verbatim, and five CTA labels in three casings pointing at one form."}]]}],"$L41"]}]]}]]}]]}]
