 show the product, and most of the critical items were maintenance debt rather than design decisions: a stale event, a misspelled advisor name, a preview domain in production."}],["$","p","The lesson I took: auditing before redesigning changes what you argue for. Walking in with twenty one findings sorted by severity turned the conversation from taste into triage, and the team shipped the first five fixes the same week.",{"className":"text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80","children":"The lesson I took: auditing before redesigning changes what you argue for. Walking in with twenty one findings sorted by severity turned the conversation from taste into triage, and the team shipped the first five fixes the same week."}]]]}]]}]]}]
